            "payload": {
              "readable": "{\"evidence_quote\":\"{\\\"aliases\\\":[\\\"A Different Kind of Truth (2026 physical reissue)\\\"],\\\"artist\\\":\\\"Van Halen\\\",\\\"chart_week\\\":\\\"2026-11-07\\\",\\\"identity_rule\\\":\\\"exact_edition\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"A Different Kind of Truth\\\"}\"\"option\":\"edition:0:MERGE_ALL_EDITIONS\"\"reason\":\"The proposed identity uses exact_edition, but the archived Billboard rule shows deluxe and standard editions are combined into one Billboard 200 entry (Lover's Target deluxe CDs, standard CD and digital all counted together). A 2026 physical reissue is not a distinct album. The correct fix is MERGE_ALL_EDITIONS.\"\"release_digest\":null\"release_url\":null\"rule_quote\":\"Aiding Lover’s first week: the set’s release in four collectible deluxe CD editions at Target, as well as dozens of merchandise/digital album bundles sold through Swift’s official website. The album also had a standard CD edition that was available widely at retail, along with an equivalent digital album that was available via all digital retailers.\"\"rules_digest\":\"73b700456c70d804fcc35ebe7cc987c47113eef0673f4c88ce9180c9437448af\"\"rules_url\":\"https://web.archive.org/web/20211010140829id_/https://www.billboard.com/articles/business/chart-beat/8528870/taylor-swift-lover-album-debuts-at-no-1-on-billboard-200-chart/\"\"status\":\"ruled\"\"verdict\":\"AMENDED\"}"
